n her penguin suit seems to sag along with her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_19","text":"I don't think I've ever seen this side of you before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_20","text":"... What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_21","text":"You're pretty cute when you get all clingy like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_22","text":"Let's hang out tomorrow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_23","text":"W-we should really head back. It's getting late.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_24","text":"Thank you for everything today.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_25","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_25","text":"Marciana takes the seashells I've been carrying in my arms.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_26","text":"I'll take these to Naga and Tia.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_27","text":"That's a lot for one person. You sure you'll be okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_28","text":"All I have to do is carry them. It shouldn't be a problem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"marciana_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_29","text":"I'll see you tomorrow, then.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_30","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_marciana_marinestudy_04_30","text":"Marciana turns and walks away with her arms full of seashells, hiding her face behind the penguin wings.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg